From: Eduard Ryzhov <1711255+ryzed@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8956-xiaomi-kenzo: wake the touchscreen over I2C SCL

The maXTouch controller sleeps and NAKs the first I2C transfer ("Failed to read T44 and T5"),
which hung the touchscreen. atmel,wakeup-method = <ATMEL_MXT_WAKEUP_I2C_SCL> makes the driver retry
after 25 ms.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8956-xiaomi-kenzo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8956-xiaomi-kenzo.dts
@@ -123,6 +123,8 @@
 	touchscreen@4a {
 		compatible = "atmel,maxtouch";
 		reg = <0x4a>;
+		/* Контроллер засыпает в простое, первый обмен по I2C его только будит. */
+		atmel,wakeup-method = <ATMEL_MXT_WAKEUP_I2C_SCL>;
 		interrupt-parent = <&tlmm>;
 		interrupts = <65 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_FALLING>;
 
